E-course for regenerative farming
How regenerative farming improves profitability and the state of environment.
[FI]
[SV]
Problem
This course is addressed at people who are looking to improve the growth, crops and environment of the country. The e-course is suitable for anyone interested in developing agriculture.
Solution
Learn about the growth condition of the soil and how holistic farming improves profitability and the state of the environment.
Description
The course is separated into 11 chapters:
1) Renewing farming;
2) Soil;
3) Diversity;
4) Carbon, Water, Climate;
5) Cultivate your field;
6) Maximise interconnection, microbes and protection;
7) Improve the soil with external amendments;
8) Minimum tillage;
9) Learn about optional topics;
10) Pay attention to the economy;
11) Measure and observe.
Related links
